type: software
title: "Native 1 m Resolution Sensitivity Analysis for Stream Power Incision Models"
abstract: >-
  Code for the native-resolution (1 m) landscape evolution sensitivity
  analysis (SPIM vs. SPACE, Landlab) reported in Section 4 of "Quantifying
  Erodibility in Stream Power Incision Models: Practical Guidance and Model
  Response Dynamics".
